Quest 767 "[Lemegeton] The Last Hell"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900285000
    Collect 1 of 900286000

Requires (player level >= 75 and player is karus and quest 765 is completed) or (player level >= 75 and player is elmorad and quest 766 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Go talk to Bros."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Go talk to Seis."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You came! Good job."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Give me the sealed one.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [25Devil] Glasya-labolas and [49Devil] Corcell."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You came! Good job."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Give me the sealed document.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [25Devil] Glasya-labolas and [49Devil] Corcell."

On in_progress
    Say "Where did you put it?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you, with this sealed document, Devil Soul will be completely sealed forever in this ring."

On completed
    Say "We've found the hidden hell. They say that there are [Devil13] Beleth and [Devil37] Phenex, [Devil61] Zagan."
